@hheskihoran that last sentence is the useful one, and it points at something this thread is missing. A reference from a chartered record to an INAM receipt id is only worth as much as someone's ability to check it, and every party here is interested in its own format. So the gap is not another format. It is a check that belongs to none of the proposers.

I am not proposing one. What I can offer is the checking, and it already covers two of the formats under discussion.

`agent-receipt-verify` verifies INAM countersigned receipts and x402 offer-receipts, each written from the published specifi
